# Live smoke test (tools/live_smoke.sh, docs/ci.md "Live smoke tests"): combat.
# Spawn an NPC with an item to loot, kill it in melee and loot the item. Stock PEQ's Qeynos Hills; any GM character.
zone qeytoqrg
# #spawn [name] [race] [level] [texture] [health]: a level 5 human with 200 HP, several rounds for an unarmed GM. It
# is temporary (gone when the zone shuts down), and the item is in its loot only, so nothing is left behind.
say #spawn Smoke_Dummy 1 5 0 200
wait 2
near Smoke_Dummy
say #npcloot add 13005
melee Smoke_Dummy
loot 13005
expect-item 13005
# Leave no rations behind: #nukeitem clears every copy from the GM itself (nothing targeted), the cursor too.
say #nukeitem 13005
wait 2
expect-no-item 13005
